{"step_index":158,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T17:30:59Z","input_tokens":2517,"cache_read_tokens":86077,"output_tokens":779,"content":"### 1. Are records provided to verify correctness?\n\n**Yes, absolutely.** The challenge organizers provided official ground-truth benchmark files in `dataset/`:\n\n1. [`dataset/sample_deletion_requests.csv`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/dataset/sample_deletion_requests.csv): Contains **32 complete sample deletion requests** (`case_01` to `case_32`).\n2. [`dataset/sample_output.csv`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/dataset/sample_output.csv): Contains the **exact golden ground-truth answers** for all 32 sample cases, including:\n   - The verified deletion status (`COMPLETE` vs `INCOMPLETE`).\n   - The exact list of steps (`FINDING`, `REMEDIATION`, `VERIFICATION`).\n   - The exact cited `evidence_id`, `system_id`, `resource_id`, `operation`, and `state`.\n   - The exact sequential step ordering.\n\n---\n\n### 2. How we verify correctness phase-by-phase\n\nWe use an automated test harness (in [`code/evaluation/main.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/main.py)) that validates each module as we build it:\n\n1. **Unit Verification (Per-Phase)**:\n   - **Intent Classifier**: Verify that all 32 sample cases are recognized as deletion requests (0 false negatives), and known non-deletion requests (such as cases 533–542 in `deletion_requests.csv`) evaluate strictly to `NOT_APPLICABLE` with `steps_json = []`.\n   - **Identity Resolver**: Verify that request emails resolve to the exact canonical `user_id` and all historical aliases match `user_audit_log.csv`.\n   - **Evidence & Policy Evaluator**: Verify that our in-memory SQLite and JSON parsers correctly identify every lingering record, exposed PII, active sync connector, and restore risk.\n\n2. **Integration Verification (Regression Against `sample_output.csv`)**:\n   We compute 4 automated correctness metrics across all 32 sample cases:\n   - **Case-Level Status Accuracy**: Must be **100% (32/32)** matching `deletion_status`.\n   - **Step-Level Precision & Recall**: Verifies that every required finding, remediation action, and verification check is detected with 0 extraneous or missing steps.\n   - **Field-Level Accuracy**: Verifies that `system_id`, `resource_id`, `operation`, `state`, and `evidence_id` match character-for-character.\n   - **Sequence Accuracy**: Verifies that the ordered array structure preserves the required phase and operation ordering.\n\n3. **Edge-Case Validation (Custom Test Suite)**:\n   - To satisfy the challenge's evaluation criteria for [`evaluation_report.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/evaluation_report.md), we also create $\\ge 3$ synthetic test cases with verified ground truth to explicitly test tricky edge cases (e.g., account tombstones with residual direct PII, active connectors that resurrect data after `reported_at`, and multi-lingual non-deletion requests)."}
